Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "This place is nothing but ruins!
Can the Master Sword really be here?",
  "1.0.1.0" => "The Master Sword is up ahead.
We must work together to retrieve it!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "First we must awaken the three sealed
statues.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "We have to look for the three sealed
statues before we can do anything else.",
  "1.0.4.0" => "It will take all three of your abilities to
awaken the sealed statues.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Our abilities?",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Mine as well?",
  "1.0.7.0" => "That sounds fine. I'm willing to try
anything.",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Sealed statues... Sealed statues...
Where are they?",
  "1.0.9.0" => "I can search in this direction.",
  "1.0.10.0" => "OK, I'll look in that direction.",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Perfect. I'll go looking as well.",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Sealed statue... Hey, is that one over
there?",
  "1.0.13.0" => "That would appear to be a sealed statue.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Hey! It's a sealed statue! I found one!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Is this what a sealed statue looks like?
Wow, I thought it'd be...bigger?",
  "1.0.16.0" => "It appears as though you've discovered a
sealed statue.",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Impa, that is the Statue of Servitude!
Please awaken it!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Your wish is my command, Princess.",
  "1.0.19.0" => "It seems I have no choice but to wait here
until the statues are fully awakened.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Darunia, that is the Statue of Wave and
Flame. Use your fire ability to awaken it!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Hrmm... OK, I'll try.",
  "1.0.22.0" => "It's gonna take a while for this to properly
wake up! I'll stay here until then!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Midna, that is the Statue of Twilight.
Use your Twilight ability to awaken it!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Sure, you got it.",
  "1.0.25.0" => "It looked like it worked, but it'll take a while to
fully wake up. I'll stay here until it's ready.",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Those who would threaten the temple...
will be punished!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Are these...ghost soldiers...?
Everyone! Watch out!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "These aren't normal enemies!
Watch out!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "We must locate a sealed statue!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "We can't let ourselves be defeated!
Not without all the statues being awoken!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Somebody's got to drive the enemies away!
The statues haven't all woken up yet!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Of course the enemies would show up
now... It's not like we're busy or anything!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Two more statues remain. We must protect our
allies until all three statues have awoken!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "One final statue remains. Our task is nearly
complete! Protect our allies at all costs!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "And with this, the temple doors should
finally open!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "The statue will not awaken in a timely
manner. I require a moment longer!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Ghost soldiers are inside the temple!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Inside the temple? That is unusual...
Someone must be manipulating them!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Is someone pulling the strings behind the
scenes? But who is this puppet master...?",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Eee hee hee!
Get them! GET THEM!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "An impostor is posing as Lana!
Everyone, be on the alert!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Sounds like I have an impostor! I guess that's
flattering, but it's still really inconvenient.",
  "1.0.43.0" => "I feel an evil presence nearby...",
  "1.0.44.0" => "I feel it too. Ooh, that's creepy. You don't
think there's an impostor around, do you?",
  "1.0.45.0" => "The enemy still lives! Finish this!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Wait a second. Lana, you don't quite look
like yourself. Are you all right?",
  "1.0.47.0" => "You and that insipid fairy are such nuisances!
I'll stomp you both if I have to!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "I guess you're not as easy to trick as you
look... Oh well. I still won't let you win!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Huh? What were we doing...?",
  "1.0.50.0" => "The wielder of the sacred sword! You've
arrived! We're here to assist you in any way!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Power's starting to radiate from the statue.
I think it's about ready to wake up!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Princess, forgive me... Waking the statue has
taken its toll on me... I must retreat for now...",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Whoa, I really overdid it waking up that statue.
I have to fall back, or else I'm rubble!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Haaa... Waking statues really takes it out
of you. You're fine without me, right?",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Our remaining forces can finish the task.
Come, to the pedestal of the sacred sword!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Let's go, Link!
The Master Sword is waiting for us!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Link! C'mon! Let's head for the pedestal of
the sacred sword!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Don't mess with me, punk!
Give me the Master Sword!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "The Master Sword cannot be controlled by
an evil hand! Your end is at hand, wizard!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Hmm. It seems this sacred location is blocking
my powers. A change of venue is in order!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Ha! Trying to run away? Pretty sneaky!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "Guh... Maybe stalling a little bit will give
my wounds a chance to heal...",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Unbelievable! I never expected the Master
Sword would be so powerful!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Our position has become disadvantageous... Let us
retreat to the temple and strike back from within!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Gaahhh... You're cheating. Then again, we
didn't give you much choice, did we?",
  "1.0.66.0" => "If you want Cia, you'll find her in the Temple
of Souls. But she's not going to be happy...",
  "1.0.67.0" => "The Master Sword is amazing! Link, as
long as we have this, we can't lose!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "We have our objective--travel to the Temple of
Souls, and use the Master Sword to defeat Cia!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "We were so close...",
  "1.0.70.0" => "We let the enemy get the better of us...
What a shame...",
  "1.0.71.0" => "I let my guard down... Forgive me!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Sorry... They got the best of me...",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Sorry... I can't keep fighting...",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Without everyone, the temple doors will remain
sealed. We have no choice but to start over.",
  "1.0.75.0" => "If we can't open the door, that's it--
there's no way in.",
  "1.0.76.0" => "The temple door is open! He who shall
wield the sacred sword has appeared!",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Please excuse our trespasses...",
  "1.0.78.0" => "C'mon, we have to fight through to the
resting place of the sacred sword!",
  "1.0.79.0" => "According to legend, statues are located to
the north, south, and west...",
  "1.0.80.0" => "I don't have time for this! Could someone
assist me?",
  "1.0.81.0" => "We're being blocked! Hey, could you come
give me a hand? I could really use it!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "Well, aren't you a rather large annoyance...
Hey! Somebody lend me a hand!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "Good. I am able to proceed.",
  "1.0.84.0" => "All right! Now I can get on with it!",
  "1.0.85.0" => "Finally! I was getting impatient!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "Hiya ha ha... I won't let you go!",
  "1.0.87.0" => "That's not Lana! Link, take her out!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "So you've done some shape-shifting?
I can still spot evil at any distance!",
  "1.0.89.0" => "The key to victory rests with the wizard's
defeat! Eliminate him immediately!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Is my assistance requested?",
  "13.0.1.0" => "Allow me to search a bit in that direction.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Master, I am detecting a high probability of
a sealed statue in that direction.",
  "13.0.3.0" => "Don't worry--I know what to look for!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Oh my! I can help look for sealed statues
as well!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "This group of enemies is really beginning 
to bother me... Can someone help?",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Why, thank you. My search can continue!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "There're baddies everywhere! I'm trapped!
I'd be ever so grateful if someone could help...",
  "13.0.8.0" => "Hooray! I can continue on!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "Sealed statues... Would that be one?
I'm sure that it is!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Master, I have located one of the sealed
statues.",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Aha! A sealed statue! Lovely!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Oh! That's a sealed statue, isn't it?",
  "13.0.13.0" => "It appears a sealed statue has been found.",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Fi, that is the Statue of Servitude.
You must get close and awaken it!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "Affirmative, Princess Zelda.",
  "13.0.16.0" => "I will remain here until the Statue of
Servitude has been fully awakened.",
  "13.0.17.0" => "Ruto, that is the Statue of Wave and Flame.
You should have the ability to wake it.",
  "13.0.18.0" => "Well, all right... Let's see if this works...",
  "13.0.19.0" => "Yeah, OK, I think this may take some time.
I'll have to stay here until it's fully awake.",
  "13.0.20.0" => "Agitha, that is the Statue of Twilight. You
should have the power to awaken it.",
  "13.0.21.0" => "Oh, can I...?",
  "13.0.22.0" => "Did that...work...? I'd better stay here and
keep an eye on this pretty statue!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Something really dangerous just appeared!
Everyone, be careful!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Are we still looking for the sealed statues?
We have to hurry!",
  "13.0.25.0" => "From what I've heard, there are statues in
the north, south, and west of this area...",
  "13.0.26.0" => "I must advise caution! If I am forced to flee,
the sealed statue will no longer awaken!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "We can't flee if we want those statues to
wake up!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "Oh no! The baddies are here... And the
pretty statue is still sleeping!",
  "13.0.29.0" => "You should protect the others while the
statues fully awaken!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "Just a little longer... You've got to protect
the others!",
  "13.0.31.0" => "Wonderful! Now we can enter the temple!",
  "13.0.32.0" => "Master, I do not see a way into the temple
other than to wait for the statues to awaken.",
  "13.0.33.0" => "Those guards seem a bit...off... Could
someone be controlling them?",
  "13.0.34.0" => "I have discovered an impostor posing as
Lana! Be on the alert!",
  "13.0.35.0" => "Ooh, I feel something dark and foreboding
nearby... Be careful!",
  "13.0.36.0" => "The statue looks like it's waking up! C'mon,
little statue! Just a bit more! Rise and shine!",
  "13.0.37.0" => "Activating the statue has drained me of my
energy. I am unfit to assist further in battle.",
  "13.0.38.0" => "Phew, waking up that statue really took it out
of me! I have to rest. Fight on without me!",
  "13.0.39.0" => "Oh my. The statue is awake, but now I'm so
very sleepy... I'll have to catch up later!",
  "13.0.40.0" => "We'll have to make do with whoever is
left! Come! To the Sacred Sword pedestal!",
  "13.0.41.0" => "The wizard is after the sacred sword?
No way! Don't let him take it!",
  "13.0.42.0" => "We're being overwhelmed! Everyone, fall
back into the temple--then strike back!",
  "13.0.43.0" => "How tragic...",
  "13.0.44.0" => "I cannot continue the battle. Forgive me...",
  "13.0.45.0" => "Ugh, I'm so sorry... I can't go on...",
  "13.0.46.0" => "Oh my, I'm so sorry... I did the best I
could... But I can't continue on...",
  "13.0.47.0" => "We won't be able to open the temple gates
now... What do we do now?",
  "13.0.48.0" => "There are a lot of really angry customers
pouring out of the temple!",
  "13.0.49.0" => "The sacred sword should be beyond here
somewhere. We have to retrieve it!",
  "13.0.50.0" => "We've got to awaken the three sealed statues
found around here if we want into the temple.",
  "13.0.51.0" => "We'll need all three of your unique abilities
if we're going to awaken those statues.",
  "13.0.52.0" => "Impa, that is the Statue of Servitude.
Get up close and awaken it!",
  "13.0.53.0" => "Darunia, that is the Statue of Wave and
Flame. Use the power of fire to awaken it.",
  "13.0.54.0" => "Midna, that is the Statue of Twilight.
Your power should awaken it!",
  "13.0.55.0" => "Now that we have the Master Sword,
let's take the fight to Cia!",
  "13.0.56.0" => "You believe you can impersonate Lana to
confuse us? Then your plan will fail!",
  "13.0.57.0" => "If you think stealing the identity of one of our
allies will help you, you're sadly mistaken!",
  "13.0.58.0" => "Hey, that's not Lana! C'mon! Let's show this
impostor the business end of a hammer!",
  "13.0.59.0" => "Heh, I can see right through that little fake
Lana of yours. How stupid do you think I am?!",
  "13.0.60.0" => "The enemy is trying to trick us into
believing that is Lana. Do not be fooled!",
  "13.0.61.0" => "Hey, cut it out! There's only one Lana on
this battlefield, and it's ME!",
}